**Job Title:**
Commodity Manager II


**Job Description:**
**The Role:**


Entegris is growing and looking for a strong Commodity Manager II to join our Direct Procurement Team supporting Plastic Fabrication.


This role is responsible for strategic sourcing and supplier management for plastic fabrication suppliers supporting Entegris' semiconductor manufacturing products and technologies.


If you are a motivated individual interested in solving complex problems within the semiconductor supply chain, this role may be a fit for you!




**What You’ll Do:**




* Drive sourcing decisions within the Plastic Fabrications commodity that will provide an insight to better supplier choices;
* Lead cost saving efforts, especially in areas of opportunity within this commodity;
* Become a strong ambassador for the sourcing organization, develop relationships with key Entegris stakeholders, and facilitate engagements that position organization for long term success;
* Develop strong relationships with suppliers’ technical teams that facilitate a deep understanding of their organizations technology roadmaps and capabilities to support Entegris product requirements;
* Assess technology/business gaps in supplier performance and implement appropriate continuous improvement activities;
* Partner with Entegris product development teams to lead the outsource manufacturing sourcing activities that enable organic business growth;
* Negotiate and manage commercial/technical supply chain to support Entegris business needs;
* Contract negotiation with critical suppliers that provide support to Entegris' Advanced Purity Solutions (APS) and Material Solutions (MS) divisions. Support sourcing, cost saving and supplier development efforts across the BU’s.



